    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi there!</strong> <br>Since you're reading this, that means you're interested in our game\u2014thank you! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is super simple: <strong>just type to summon an ancient god!</strong> That's it! Sounds easy, right? But maybe... there's more to it? If you're curious about the process, we highly recommend giving it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, that's everything you need to know about this game! \ud83c\udf89 Thanks for reading! We release a new game every month, so if you enjoy this one\u2014or if you like games that don\u2019t take themselves too seriously\u2014we might just get along!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishing you a great time, my friend! Much appreciated! \ud83d\ude4f</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi there!</strong> <br>Since you're reading this, that means you're interested in our game\u2014thank you! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is super simple: <strong>just type to summon an ancient god!</strong> That's it! Sounds easy, right? But maybe... there's more to it? If you're curious about the process, we highly recommend giving it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, that's everything you need to know about this game! \ud83c\udf89 Thanks for reading! We release a new game every month, so if you enjoy this one\u2014or if you like games that don\u2019t take themselves too seriously\u2014we might just get along!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishing you a great time, my friend! Much appreciated! \ud83d\ude4f</strong></p>",
